{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55490","headline":"题棺木 一 · 朱贞白","name":"题棺木 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久久终需要，而（《类说》作「如」）今未要君。\n有时闲忆者，大是要知闻。\n（《宋朝事实类苑》卷六三引《杨文公谈苑》。\n《类说》卷五三仅引前二句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}